16
00:00:31,624 --> 00:00:34,160
Motor Authority, Autocar,

17
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:38,015
CarAdvice, Wikipedia, Barrett-Jackson,

18
00:00:38,015 --> 00:00:40,855
