43
00:01:42,121 --> 00:01:44,948
A 2007 article it links to said

44
00:01:44,948 --> 00:01:47,136
eleven hundred G-Wagons.

45
00:01:47,486 --> 00:01:48,586
By our arithmetic,

46
00:01:48,586 --> 00:01:51,457
three hundred fifty million over twelve hundred

47
00:01:51,457 --> 00:01:54,451
